id: segger_rtt_config_siwx91x
label: SEGGER RTT Config define
package: platform_siwx91x
description: >
  SiWx91x-specific override of segger_rtt's SEGGER_RTT_Conf.h. Sets
  SEGGER_RTT_MAX_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY to the value derived from the SiWx91x
  FreeRTOS port (configLIBRARY_MAX_SYSCALL_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY=5,
  configPRIO_BITS=6 -> 0x14) so wireless/P2P/DMA ISRs are actually masked
  during RTT/SystemView critical sections.
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
category: Third Party|Segger|RTT|Configuration
ui_hints:
  visibility: never
provides:
  - name: segger_rtt_config_siwx91x
requires:
  - name: segger_rtt
define:
  - name: SEGGER_RTT_MAX_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY
    value: '0x14'